    "allowanceSummary": "$15–$60 monthly usage value depending on the model. Five-hour limit: 20% of its monthly allowance; weekly: 50%.",
    "terms": [
      {
        "label": "How usage is counted",
        "value": "Input, output and cached tokens consume the selected model’s dollar-denominated allowance at Go rates. These are usage accounting rates, not an extra invoice on top of the subscription. Model allowance values are not balances to add together.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/console/go#usage-limits"
      },
      {
        "label": "When you reach a limit",
        "value": "Requests are blocked unless you enable Use balance and have paid Console credits. That opt-in continues requests using pay-as-you-go credits. Free models remain available.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/console/go#usage-beyond-limits"
      },
      {
        "label": "Privacy matters by model",
        "value": "Muse Spark Contributor allows prompts and completions to be used for training and is not zero-data-retention. Grok and GPT Luna list 30-day retention. Other listed models show zero-day retention; DeepSeek’s agreement is currently valid through October 31, 2026.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/console/go#privacy"
      },
      {
        "label": "Workspace and client requirements",
        "value": "One Go or Go Plus subscriber per workspace. Designed for coding-agent requests. Clients need their own user agent and stable session identification. Validated clients and version restrictions are listed below.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/console/go#where-can-i-use-it"
      },
      {
        "label": "Regional and temporary access",
        "value": "Muse Spark Contributor is limited to regions allowed by Meta. LongCat 2.5 Preview Free and Space Bunny Free are temporary offers. OpenCode may change models and allowances.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/console/go"
      },
      {
        "label": "Renewal and cancellation",
        "value": "Recurring charges continue until you cancel through account settings. The general paid-service terms do not specify a Go-specific refund entitlement or when remaining access ends after cancellation.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://opencode.ai/legal/terms-of-service"
      },
      {
        "label": "Reset and billing details still to check",
        "value": "The cited terms give five-hour, weekly and monthly limits but do not establish the exact reset anchor, cross-model consumption rules, rollover or a Go-specific refund policy. Check the Console before relying on those details.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/console/go"
      }
